<title>USA: CompUSA enters $150 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>CompUSA enters $150 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompUSA Inc on Thursday it entered into a three-year $150 million credit facility with a group of 14 banks led by NationsBank Corp.</p>
<p>The retailer said the senior unsecured revolving credit facility replaced an existing $75 million unsecured bank agreement.</p>
<p>&quot;The new credit facility will provide the company with additional financial flexibility as we continue to grow all of our related businesses in the future,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
